4ce1ca`.\n\nImage reference from the opt-in guide: `ghcr.io/miaai-lab/glm-5.3-flash-2x-dgx-sparks:exl3` local Id `sha256:9581c4c7425786be27a7904a78c01bb27ae138e33840e605ecc706e76c761900`.\n\n## Use\n\n```bash\ninstall -m 644 cooperative_moe.so ~/.cache/vllm-glm53-flash/cooperative_moe/cooperative_moe.so\necho 'aa3fe5e9387c7e0d42d685fb2ca8a5fb959ad956600236baac078a9076c17a1c  cooperative_moe.so' | sha256sum -c\npython3 extensions/cooperative_moe/prepare_profile.py \\\n  --stock overlay/exl3.py \\\n  --artifacts ~/.cache/vllm-glm53-flash/cooperative_moe \\\n  --runtime-directory /root/.cache/vllm/cooperative_moe \\\n  --output ~/.cache/vllm-glm53-flash/cooperative_moe/exl3-cooperative.py\n```\n\nCopy the same `.so` and `runtime.py` to both ranks. Full sequence: `docs/cooperative-moe-quickstart.md`."}